# This project currently calls the public GitHub Search API without
# authentication and does not read any environment variables. This file
# documents the planned variable name ahead of implementing the roadmap
# item "Поддержка авторизации через токен GitHub" (see README.md).
#
# Once implemented: a GitHub personal access token to raise the Search API
# rate limit from 10 requests/minute (unauthenticated) to 30 requests/minute
# (authenticated). Omitting it will keep the tool working exactly as it does
# today, falling back to the public, unauthenticated API.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=
